POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas/inexistente/cancelar
Content-Type: application/json

### UC02 reserva sem motorista → esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patioId": "p",
  "veiculoId": "v"
